@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy | Elevated Notary Services</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for Elevated Notary Services covering website inquiries, signing coordination, payment processing, and client data protection." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Effective Date: @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM d, yyyy") &bull; Elevated Notary Services (Cleveland, Tennessee)</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
        <div class="card" style="gap:1.1rem;">
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                When you request a signing, schedule an appointment, or contact Elevated Notary Services, we collect only the information needed to coordinate and deliver your notary or loan signing service — including your name, organization, phone number, email address, signing location, and appointment notes.
            </p>

            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>
                We use your information strictly to schedule and fulfill notary and loan signing assignments, communicate order status updates, coordinate with authorized title companies, lenders, or vetted signing agents, and comply with applicable Tennessee and federal notarial record-keeping laws. We never sell your personal information.
            </p>

            <h2>3. Payment Processing &amp; Third-Party Platforms</h2>
            <p>
                Electronic payments (such as invoices or service fees processed via Stripe, Square, PayPal, or title company ACH) are handled directly by PCI-DSS compliant third-party payment processors. Elevated Notary Services does not store raw credit card numbers on this website. Partner order portals (Notary Everyday), online scheduling (Google Calendar), and Remote Online Notarization (RON) platforms operate under their respective privacy and security policies.
            </p>

            <h2>4. Data Security &amp; Retention</h2>
            <p>
                We maintain administrative, technical, and physical safeguards designed to protect confidential closing packages, identification records, and contact information. Notarial journals and statutory records are retained in accordance with Tennessee law.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
            <p>
                This Progressive Web App (PWA) uses essential browser storage and service-worker caching solely to provide fast, reliable offline-capable navigation.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights &amp; Contact</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
                You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your non-statutory contact information at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:Bhsmith@elevatednotaryservs.com" style="text-decoration:underline;">Bhsmith@elevatednotaryservs.com</a> or calling <a href="tel:4233758770" style="text-decoration:underline;">(423) 375-8770</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
